{"id":"n66587-1-7","stage":1,"title":"키우다 · 扩大","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66587-1-7-1","ko":"이 전단지 좀 봐 줘. 뒤에서 봐도 잘 보여?","zh":"帮我看看这份传单吧。从后面看也能看清楚吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"전단지","meaning":"传单","explanation":"전단지：传单","readings":[{"term":"전단지","audio":"/audio/3230c9031aa1ea5a1b7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:전단지:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"전단지","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전단지","audio":"/audio/3230c9031aa1ea5a1b7d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"봐","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줘","audio":"/audio/18f9b8e039d5f6a8cee6.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에서","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에서","audio":"/audio/96edfc28a1722c7132da.mp3"}},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐도","audio":"/audio/fdd01bd86a193dbd13e5.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"보여?","meaning":"给看","explanation":"보이다：给看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59531","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3230c9031aa1ea5a","term":"전단지","zh":"传单","audio":"/audio/3230c9031aa1ea5a1b7d.mp3","definition":"用于宣传、通知的单张印刷品。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronu